DESCRIPTION:After years of dispensing dubious wisdom on Oh My Dog\, Jack\, 
 Seann and Sara have decided to broaden their horizons. No longer limited to
  canine conundrums\, they're now tackling whatever irks us most\, so even m
 ore people can benefit from their much-sought-after advice. Join them for a
  live comedy "help desk" where they solve life's minor inconveniences and m
 odern dilemmas that have pushed us over the edge – with plenty of audienc
 e participation\, terrible advice and the occasional genuinely useful solut
 ion.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/another-day-rui
 ned-with-jack-dee-seann-walsh-and-sara-morgan/
